I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to grant more. The fetch would also send untrusted feed text to an external host, which the node isn't authorized to do. The classifier below uses only `inference-llm` and is otherwise unchanged.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{feed-item, classification};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(item: feed-item) -> classification;
}
